msgid "Insufficient permissions"
msgstr "Permisos insuficientes"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1145
#: templates/admin-status-health.php:229
msgid "No provider is connected, so there is no connection to check."
msgstr ""
"No hay ningún proveedor conectado, así que no hay conexión que revisar."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1176
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1634
msgid "Stored Credentials Unreadable"
msgstr "No se pueden leer las credenciales guardadas"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1177
msgid ""
"Sync is paused because the saved cloud credentials cannot be decrypted. This "
"is not the same as \"never configured\" — the cloud provider details are "
"still in the database, but the WordPress salts changed since they were saved "
"(commonly after restoring a database from a different environment)."
msgstr ""
"La sincronización está en pausa porque no se pueden descifrar las "
"credenciales guardadas. No es lo mismo que “nunca se configuró”: los datos "
"del proveedor siguen en la base, pero las salts de WordPress cambiaron desde "
"que se guardaron (algo habitual después de restaurar una base de otro "
"entorno)."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1178
msgid ""
"Re-enter the credentials in Cloud Provider › Credentials. Everything else "
"(provider selection, container name, sync state) is preserved."
msgstr ""
"Volvé a ingresar las credenciales en Proveedor de nube › Credenciales. Todo "
"lo demás (proveedor elegido, nombre del contenedor, estado de la "
"sincronización) se conserva."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1181
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1636
#: templates/admin-overview.php:116 templates/admin-status-health.php:154
msgid "Re-enter Credentials"
msgstr "Volver a ingresar las credenciales"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1190
msgid "Sync & Offloading Not Available"
msgstr "Sincronización y descarga no disponibles"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1191
msgid "Connect a cloud provider in Cloud Provider › Connection first."
msgstr "Primero conectá un proveedor en Proveedor de nube › Conexión."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1194
#: templates/admin-overview.php:486
msgid "Go to Cloud Provider"
msgstr "Ir al proveedor de nube"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1200
msgid "Steps to Enable Sync"
msgstr "Pasos para habilitar la sincronización"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1202
msgid "Go to Cloud Provider › Connection"
msgstr "Ir a Proveedor de nube › Conexión"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1203
msgid "Configure your cloud storage provider"
msgstr "Configurá tu proveedor de almacenamiento en la nube"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1204
msgid "Test the connection"
msgstr "Probá la conexión"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1205
msgid "Save your configuration"
msgstr "Guardá tu configuración"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1206
msgid "Return to this screen to sync files"
msgstr "Volvé a esta pantalla para sincronizar los archivos"

#. translators: 1: the storage service (e.g. Amazon S3), 2: the name of the bucket
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1305
#, php-format
msgid "the %1$s bucket %2$s"
msgstr "el bucket de %1$s %2$s"

#. translators: %s: the name of the storage container
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1312
#, php-format
msgid "the Azure Blob Storage container %s"
msgstr "el contenedor de Azure Blob Storage %s"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1313
#: templates/admin-provider-connection.php:76
msgid "Azure Blob Storage"
msgstr "Azure Blob Storage"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1319
msgid "No cloud provider is connected. Media is served from this server."
msgstr ""
"No hay ningún proveedor de nube conectado. Los medios se sirven desde este "
"servidor."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1321
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Apagado"

#. translators: 1: short reason for the pause, 2: number of consecutive failures
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1328
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Paused (%1$s): %2$d consecutive failures. Uploads are refused until the next "
"successful connection."
msgstr ""
"En pausa (%1$s): %2$d fallos consecutivos. Las subidas se rechazan hasta la "
"próxima conexión exitosa."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1333
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1386
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Pendiente"

#. translators: 1: number of files synced, 2: where they are, 3: number of files that still have a local copy
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1340
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s files synced to %2$s; %3$s still have a copy on this server."
msgstr ""
"%1$s archivos sincronizados en %2$s; %3$s todavía tienen una copia en este "
"servidor."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1346
#: templates/admin-overview.php:202 templates/admin-status-health.php:175
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Activo"

#. translators: 1: number of files synced, 2: where they are
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1353
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s files synced to %2$s; still served from this server until offloading is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"%1$s archivos sincronizados en %2$s; se siguen sirviendo desde este servidor "
"hasta que se active el offloading."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1358
#: includes/Enums/class-plugin-state.php:55 templates/admin-overview.php:154
#: templates/admin-overview.php:260 templates/admin-sync-sync.php:175
msgid "Synced"
msgstr "Sincronizado"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1359
msgid "offloading off"
msgstr "offloading apagado"

#. translators: 1: number of files synced so far, 2: number of files pending
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1365
#, php-format
msgid "A sync is in progress: %1$s files done, %2$s pending."
msgstr ""
"Hay una sincronización en curso: %1$s archivos listos, %2$s pendientes."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1370
#: templates/admin-overview.php:256
msgid "Syncing"
msgstr "Sincronizando"

#. translators: 1: where the files go, 2: number of files synced so far, 3: number pending
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1378
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Configured for %1$s. A sync was interrupted: %2$s files done, %3$s pending."
msgstr ""
"Configurado para %1$s. Una sincronización quedó interrumpida: %2$s archivos "
"listos, %3$s pendientes."

#. translators: %s: where the files go
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1384
#, php-format
msgid "Configured for %s. Nothing synced yet."
msgstr "Configurado para %s. Todavía no se sincronizó nada."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1387
msgid "not synced"
msgstr "sin sincronizar"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1399
msgid "Support forum"
msgstr "Foro de soporte"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1406
msgid "Where the keys come from"
msgstr "De dónde salen las claves"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1408
msgid ""
"Azure: portal › your storage account › Access keys. The container must allow "
"anonymous read of blobs (public access level Blob); a private container is "
"refused."
msgstr ""
"Azure: portal › tu cuenta de almacenamiento › Claves de acceso. El "
"contenedor tiene que permitir la lectura anónima de blobs (nivel de acceso "
"público Blob); un contenedor privado se rechaza."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1409
msgid ""
"S3-compatible: the keys come from the service's console (the form says where "
"for each one), and the bucket must let anyone read its objects."
msgstr ""
"Compatible con S3: las claves salen de la consola del servicio (el "
"formulario indica dónde en cada caso), y el bucket tiene que permitir que "
"cualquiera lea sus objetos."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1410
msgid ""
"Test Connection checks the credentials and that browsers can read what is "
"stored. Both must pass before Save is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Probar conexión comprueba las credenciales y que los navegadores puedan leer "
"lo que está guardado. Las dos cosas tienen que pasar antes de que se "
"habilite Guardar."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1414
msgid "Credentials: rotate the key, or remove the provider"
msgstr "Credenciales: rotar la clave o quitar el proveedor"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1415
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1430
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1446
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1563
msgid "Status › Health"
msgstr "Estado › Salud"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1416
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1461
msgid "Settings › Serving (Force HTTPS)"
msgstr "Ajustes › Entrega (forzar HTTPS)"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1422
msgid "What can change here"
msgstr "Qué se puede cambiar acá"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1424
msgid ""
"A new access key is tested against the same account and container before it "
"replaces the saved one; the media in the cloud is not touched."
msgstr ""
"Una clave de acceso nueva se prueba contra la misma cuenta y el mismo "
"contenedor antes de reemplazar la guardada; los medios en la nube no se "
"tocan."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1425
msgid ""
"Deleting the provider forgets the credentials and the tracking table. The "
"files stay in the cloud. While offloading is active, disconnect first."
msgstr ""
"Borrar el proveedor olvida las credenciales y la tabla de seguimiento. Los "
"archivos se quedan en la nube. Con el offloading activo, primero desconectá."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1431
#: templates/admin-provider-credentials.php:140
msgid "Sync & Offloading › Disconnect"
msgstr "Sincronización y offloading › Desconectar"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1437
msgid "How the sync runs"
msgstr "Cómo corre la sincronización"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1439
msgid ""
"The initial sync runs in this browser tab and stops if you close it; it "
"resumes where it left off. Files already in the cloud are skipped, files "
"over the size limit are left out."
msgstr ""
"La sincronización inicial corre en esta pestaña del navegador y se detiene "
"si la cerrás; retoma donde quedó. Los archivos que ya están en la nube se "
"saltean; los que superan el límite de tamaño quedan afuera."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1440
msgid ""
"A file that fails is listed with its error and can be retried; the rest of "
"the library is not held back by it."
msgstr ""
"Un archivo que falla queda listado con su error y se puede reintentar; el "
"resto de la biblioteca no se frena por él."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1444
msgid "Settings › Transfers (size limit, timeout)"
msgstr "Ajustes › Transferencias (límite de tamaño, tiempo de espera)"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1452
msgid "What it changes"
msgstr "Qué cambia"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1454
msgid ""
"With offloading on, WordPress hands out the cloud address for every file and "
"new uploads go straight to the cloud. Nothing in your posts or your database "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Con el offloading activo, WordPress entrega la dirección de la nube para "
"cada archivo y las subidas nuevas van directo a la nube. Nada cambia en tus "
"entradas ni en tu base de datos."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1455
msgid ""
"Deleting the local copies frees the disk; the files keep being served from "
"the cloud. Disconnect brings them back."
msgstr ""
"Borrar las copias locales libera el disco; los archivos se siguen sirviendo "
"desde la nube. Desconectar los trae de vuelta."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1467
msgid "What a disconnect does"
msgstr "Qué hace una desconexión"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1469
msgid ""
"Every file is downloaded from the cloud back to this server, then offloading "
"is turned off. The files in the cloud are left as they are."
msgstr ""
"Cada archivo se descarga de la nube de vuelta a este servidor y después se "
"apaga el offloading. Los archivos en la nube quedan como están."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1470
msgid ""
"It needs enough free disk for the whole library; Status › System shows what "
"is free."
msgstr ""
"Necesita disco libre suficiente para toda la biblioteca; Estado › Sistema "
"muestra cuánto hay libre."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1474
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1513
msgid "Status › System"
msgstr "Estado › Sistema"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1475
msgid "Cloud Provider › Credentials (delete the provider afterwards)"
msgstr "Proveedor de nube › Credenciales (borrar el proveedor después)"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1481
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1494
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1507
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1537
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1554
msgid "What this screen is for"
msgstr "Para qué sirve esta pantalla"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1483
msgid ""
"The size limit decides which files the initial sync takes; the timeout "
"decides how long each transfer request may take. Both apply to every "
"provider."
msgstr ""
"El límite de tamaño decide qué archivos toma la sincronización inicial; el "
"tiempo de espera decide cuánto puede tardar cada solicitud de transferencia. "
"Los dos aplican a cualquier proveedor."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1487
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1562
msgid "Sync & Offloading › Sync"
msgstr "Sincronización y offloading › Sincronización"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1488
msgid "Status › System (PHP limits)"
msgstr "Estado › Sistema (límites de PHP)"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1496
msgid ""
"How the media is handed out once it is in the cloud. Force HTTPS keeps the "
"cloud URLs on https even when the site itself runs on http."
msgstr ""
"Cómo se entregan los medios una vez que están en la nube. Forzar HTTPS "
"mantiene las URL de la nube en https aunque el sitio corra en http."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1500
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1561
msgid "Cloud Provider › Connection"
msgstr "Proveedor de nube › Conexión"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1501
msgid "Sync & Offloading › Offloading"
msgstr "Sincronización y offloading › Offloading"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1509
msgid ""
"The plugin is quiet by default. Debug logging writes one line per operation "
"to the PHP error log while you troubleshoot; credentials are never logged."
msgstr ""
"El plugin es silencioso por defecto. El registro de depuración escribe una "
"línea por operación en el log de errores de PHP mientras diagnosticás; las "
"credenciales nunca se registran."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1520
msgid "How health works"
msgstr "Cómo funciona la salud"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1522
msgid ""
"Every upload and every check of the connection records a success or a "
"failure. After three consecutive failures the plugin refuses new uploads "
"instead of writing them anywhere else, and says so on every screen until the "
"next success."
msgstr ""
"Cada subida y cada comprobación de la conexión registra un éxito o un fallo. "
"Después de tres fallos consecutivos el plugin rechaza las subidas nuevas en "
"vez de escribirlas en otro lado, y lo dice en todas las pantallas hasta el "
"siguiente éxito."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1526
#: templates/admin-sync-disconnect.php:114
msgid "Cloud Provider › Credentials"
msgstr "Proveedor de nube › Credenciales"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1528
msgid "Tools › Site Health"
msgstr "Herramientas › Salud del sitio"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1539
msgid ""
"The environment the plugin runs in, as a support request wants it: "
"WordPress, PHP, the plugin build and the provider. Copy it into a report."
msgstr ""
"El entorno en el que corre el plugin, como lo pide una consulta de soporte: "
"WordPress, PHP, la build del plugin y el proveedor. Copialo en un reporte."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1545
msgid "Report an issue on GitHub"
msgstr "Reportar un problema en GitHub"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1556
msgid ""
"The four cards are the plugin's state as a person sees it: whether a "
"provider is connected, whether the library is in the cloud, whether the site "
"serves it from there."
msgstr ""
"Las cuatro tarjetas son el estado del plugin como lo ve una persona: si hay "
"un proveedor conectado, si la biblioteca está en la nube, si el sitio la "
"sirve desde ahí."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1557
msgid ""
"Storage Overview shows the last reading of the container, kept for five "
"minutes; Refresh lists it again (a few seconds on a large library)."
msgstr ""
"Resumen de almacenamiento muestra la última lectura del contenedor, guardada "
"cinco minutos; Actualizar lo vuelve a listar (unos segundos en una "
"biblioteca grande)."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1589
msgid "credentials unreadable"
msgstr "credenciales ilegibles"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1592
msgid "permission denied"
msgstr "permiso denegado"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1594
msgid "container not found"
msgstr "no se encontró el contenedor"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1596
msgid "transfer timed out"
msgstr "transferencia agotó el tiempo de espera"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1598
msgid "connection error"
msgstr "error de conexión"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1600
msgid "cloud unreachable"
msgstr "no se llega a la nube"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1635
msgid ""
"Your saved cloud credentials cannot be decrypted. This usually means the "
"WordPress salts (AUTH_KEY / SECURE_AUTH_KEY) changed since these credentials "
"were saved — for example after restoring a database from a different "
"environment. Re-enter your credentials to fix this."
msgstr ""
"No se pueden descifrar las credenciales guardadas. Casi siempre es porque "
"las salts de WordPress (AUTH_KEY / SECURE_AUTH_KEY) cambiaron desde que se "
"guardaron; por ejemplo, después de restaurar una base de otro entorno. Volvé "
"a ingresarlas para resolverlo."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1642
msgid "Cloud Permission Denied"
msgstr "La nube denegó el permiso"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1643
msgid ""
"The cloud provider rejected the credentials: the key is wrong, expired, or "
"lacks permission. Verify the credentials and re-enter them."
msgstr ""
"El proveedor rechazó las credenciales: la clave está mal, vencida o no tiene "
"permiso suficiente. Revisalas y volvé a ingresarlas."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1644
msgid "Update Credentials"
msgstr "Actualizar las credenciales"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1649
msgid "Container Not Found"
msgstr "No se encontró el contenedor"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1650
msgid ""
"The configured container or bucket does not exist on the cloud provider. "
"Check that the name is spelled correctly and that it has been created."
msgstr ""
"El contenedor o bucket configurado no existe en el proveedor. Fijate que el "
"nombre esté bien escrito y que esté creado."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1651
msgid "Open Cloud Provider Settings"
msgstr "Abrir los ajustes del proveedor"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1656
msgid "Cloud Transfer Timed Out"
msgstr "Transferencia a la nube agotó el tiempo de espera"

#. translators: %d: the Transfer Timeout setting, in seconds
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1659
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A transfer to the cloud took longer than allowed: the Transfer Timeout (%d "
"seconds) for an upload, at least 300 seconds for a download. Raise the "
"setting if this host or its connection is slow; if transfers used to work at "
"this value, check the connection to the provider."
msgstr ""
"Una transferencia a la nube tardó más de lo permitido: el tiempo de espera "
"de transferencia (%d segundos) para una subida, al menos 300 segundos para "
"una descarga. Subí el ajuste si este servidor o su conexión son lentos; si "
"las transferencias funcionaban con este valor, revisá la conexión con el "
"proveedor."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1662
msgid "Open Settings"
msgstr "Abrir Configuración"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1668
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1678
msgid "Cloud Connection Error"
msgstr "Error de conexión con la nube"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1671
msgid "An unexpected error occurred while talking to the cloud provider."
msgstr "Hubo un error inesperado al hablar con el proveedor."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1672
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1680
msgid "Update your credentials in the Cloud Provider tab"
msgstr "Actualizá tus credenciales en la pestaña Proveedor en la nube"

#. translators: %d: number of minutes
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1709
#: templates/admin-overview.php:438
#, php-format
msgid "%d minute ago"
msgid_plural "%d minutes ago"
msgstr[0] "hace %d minuto"
msgstr[1] "hace %d minutos"

#. translators: %d: number of hours
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1713
#: templates/admin-overview.php:442
#, php-format
msgid "%d hour ago"
msgid_plural "%d hours ago"
msgstr[0] "hace %d hora"
msgstr[1] "hace %d horas"

#. translators: %d: number of days
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1717
#, php-format
msgid "%d day ago"
msgid_plural "%d days ago"
msgstr[0] "hace %d día"
msgstr[1] "hace %d días"

#. translators: %s: human-readable time, e.g. "5 minutes ago"
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1735
#, php-format
msgid "Last successful connection: %s"
msgstr "Última conexión exitosa: %s"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1741
#: templates/admin-overview.php:217 templates/admin-status-health.php:192
msgid "New uploads are refused until the connection recovers."
msgstr "Las subidas nuevas se rechazan hasta que la conexión se recupere."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1801
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1900
msgid "Security check failed"
msgstr "Falló la verificación de seguridad."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1858
msgid ""
"Test the connection before saving: only a configuration that passed Test "
"Connection can be saved."
msgstr ""
"Probá la conexión antes de guardar: solo se puede guardar una configuración "
"que haya pasado Probar conexión."

